{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Covid19 - Toilet Paper Run",
    "steam_appid": 2454500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/cb30850ce73edf993e9adbe3f6f4db18.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br>Based on real-life events with absurdity cranked up to a 100, Covid19 - Toilet Paper Run has you, well, make a run to get toilet paper. Jeff is down to his last roll and the world is quickly running out of stock thanks to hoarders!<br><br>Luckily, one of the last places to still have the paper is right across the city square. Unluckily, infected people are still carelessly roaming around outside. Can he make a run without getting infected himself?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/a4676cac5d24ec0b47e702f63f5427cb.poster.avif?t=1725878042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/a4676cac5d24ec0b47e702f63f5427cb.webm?t=1725878042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/3bea927a54689e709464c4e49da90d7b.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br>There are three simple goals in this short third person shooter:<br><br>1. Run to the store on the other side of city square<br>2. Run back to your apartment with toilet paper<br>3. DON'T GET INFECTED (actually, this really should be #1)<br><br>With Covid-19 viruses everywhere, you better be careful. A single virus is enough to get you infected, unless you manage to find some sort of protection that enables you to take a few virus hits. Spray bottles are your best friend. Wierdly enough, they never seem to run out of hand sanitizer, so make sure to use it in healthy doses!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/265646fd847534262c5255431e880327.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/f8ada5698ac38e93a39a5f52e0691921.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/3c77accb83b8089bfb9e5e8a07bc2655.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br>Everyday household item turned into weapon! Use sanitizer filled spray bottles to destroy any approching viruses trying to infect you in a disinfecting frenzy that might just have you break world record in mouse clicks per second (if you actually do this, the game will break. There you go, an extra challenege!)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/Seperator.png?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/6e255c876938eb229bab4c9b7af10caf.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/f8a98fd5cd57c1fac0fd84be421166d3.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br>Whatever your opinion on use of face masks was, here they defintely help. They are Jeff's only line of defense against the virus, so make sure to pick up as many as you can find!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/Seperator.png?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/a7eabdb3a76415597a7cf3aa0462925f.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/d157a60f96c05cb57f134107ae32fc30.avif?t=1725878042\" /></span><br><br>Not all shooters need to be about killing monsters, aliens, robots or other people. Here you get to annihilate something that more than likely affected you in real life - coronavirus. Be careful! They have strenght in numbers and will do their best to infect you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454500/extras/Seperator.png?t=1725878042\" /></span>",
